 "segments": [
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "landing",
   "muteApp": true,
   "say": "So Yarrow is a ticket harness helping you creating tickets, implementing them, and reviewing them, all in one place.",
   "from": 0,
   "to": 251,
   "src": [
    7.1,
    16.2
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "landing",
   "muteApp": true,
   "say": "Let me show you.",
   "from": 251,
   "to": 273,
   "src": [
    19.85,
    20.6
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "act",
   "speed": 7,
   "cam": "full",
   "from": 273,
   "to": 367,
   "src": [
    20.6,
    42.6
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "dash",
   "muteApp": true,
   "say": "Okay, so here you can see the Yarrow dashboard. I've imported a very simple to-do app from GitHub,",
   "from": 367,
   "to": 604,
   "src": [
    42.75,
    51.3
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "dash",
   "muteApp": true,
   "say": "it comes from GitHub issues, but you can use Jira, Linear or Trello.",
   "from": 604,
   "to": 742,
   "src": [
    55.34,
    59.95
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "dash",
   "muteApp": true,
   "say": "so I will create a new one.",
   "from": 742,
   "to": 785,
   "src": [
    63.85,
    65.3
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "act",
   "speed": 3,
   "cam": "full",
   "from": 785,
   "to": 831,
   "src": [
    65.3,
    69.9
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "modalChat",
   "muteApp": true,
   "say": "Currently in the to-do app, you can see all the to-dos mixed up.",
   "from": 831,
   "to": 976,
   "src": [
    75.62,
    81.5
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "modalChat",
   "muteApp": true,
   "say": "So I need buttons above the list, like a All button, To Do button, Doing and Done.",
   "from": 976,
   "to": 1132,
   "src": [
    87.82,
    96.3
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "modalChat",
   "say": "Got it. Let me look at your app to draft that.",
   "from": 1132,
   "to": 1202,
   "src": [
    102.55,
    104.85
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "modal",
   "say": "I've put a first version beside you with those four buttons above the list.",
   "from": 1202,
   "to": 1301,
   "src": [
    110.7,
    114.0
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "act",
   "speed": 3,
   "cam": "full",
   "from": 1301,
   "to": 1372,
   "src": [
    131.75,
    138.8
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "full",
   "muteApp": true,
   "say": "So let's start it.",
   "from": 1372,
   "to": 1414,
   "src": [
    138.85,
    140.25
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "act",
   "speed": 3.5,
   "cam": "full",
   "from": 1414,
   "to": 1500,
   "src": [
    140.25,
    150.25
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "working",
   "muteApp": true,
   "say": "There we go. So the ticket is starting in the cloud. As you can see, Muse Wonder is working on it.",
   "from": 1500,
   "to": 1675,
   "src": [
    150.3,
    156.7
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "working",
   "muteApp": true,
   "say": "so we will give it a few minutes,",
   "from": 1675,
   "to": 1731,
   "src": [
    157.75,
    159.6
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "act",
   "speed": 148,
   "cam": "working",
   "label": "timelapse",
   "since": 150.3,
   "bubble": false,
   "from": 1731,
   "to": 1827,
   "src": [
    159.6,
    634.2
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "act",
   "speed": 1.5,
   "cam": "room",
   "bubble": false,
   "from": 1827,
   "to": 1883,
   "src": [
    634.2,
    637.0
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "room",
   "say": "All right, so Muse Wonder has finished its job. It has produced a video, actually a live interactive video.",
   "from": 1883,
   "to": 2088,
   "src": [
    752.3,
    759.55
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "room",
   "say": "Let's watch it.",
   "from": 2088,
   "to": 2110,
   "src": [
    759.62,
    760.75
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "demo",
   "say": "And here it is with the change. Above the list, you've now got four buttons: All and To Do and Doing and Done.",
   "from": 2110,
   "to": 2312,
   "src": [
    777.9,
    785.15
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "demo",
   "say": "So let me click Doing, and you'll notice only the two in-progress tasks",
   "from": 2312,
   "to": 2444,
   "src": [
    792.2,
    796.84
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "room",
   "say": "Okay, wait a second. I have a question.",
   "muteApp": true,
   "from": 2444,
   "to": 2495,
   "src": [
    796.84,
    799.25
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "room",
   "say": "Of course. Go ahead.",
   "from": 2495,
   "to": 2535,
   "src": [
    803.2,
    804.55
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "room",
   "muteApp": true,
   "say": "Can you",
   "from": 2535,
   "to": 2545,
   "src": [
    833.55,
    833.88
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "room",
   "say": "click on the Doing button and then add a new task?",
   "from": 2545,
   "to": 2611,
   "src": [
    838.6,
    840.8
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "room",
   "say": "Doing is on, so only the two in-progress tasks show. The new task saved but stays hidden,",
   "from": 2611,
   "to": 2795,
   "src": [
    850.8,
    857.12
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "room",
   "muteApp": true,
   "say": "Okay, I see.",
   "from": 2795,
   "to": 2811,
   "src": [
    858.0,
    858.55
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "room",
   "muteApp": true,
   "say": "I think that would be interesting to add a new ticket, in order to set the status of a task while we are creating it. What do you think?",
   "from": 2811,
   "to": 3061,
   "src": [
    882.4,
    892.35
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "room",
   "say": "Yeah, that makes sense. It would let you pick the status right when you add a task.",
   "from": 3061,
   "to": 3181,
   "src": [
    896.55,
    900.55
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "room",
   "muteApp": true,
   "say": "Can you create it?",
   "from": 3181,
   "to": 3203,
   "src": [
    902.2,
    902.95
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "room",
   "say": "I'll put that ticket together for you. It's there as a card for you.",
   "from": 3203,
   "to": 3299,
   "src": [
    907.1,
    910.5
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "room",
   "muteApp": true,
   "say": "let's create this new ticket.",
   "from": 3299,
   "to": 3353,
   "src": [
    928.55,
    930.35
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "act",
   "speed": 2,
   "cam": "room",
   "from": 3353,
   "to": 3400,
   "src": [
    930.35,
    933.45
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "room",
   "muteApp": true,
   "say": "It appears here. And for this ticket, I'm happy with it, so I will merge it.",
   "from": 3400,
   "to": 3535,
   "src": [
    933.78,
    938.45
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "act",
   "speed": 1.5,
   "cam": "full",
   "from": 3535,
   "to": 3620,
   "src": [
    938.45,
    942.7
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "full",
   "muteApp": true,
   "say": "Okay, there you go.",
   "from": 3620,
   "to": 3662,
   "src": [
    942.7,
